@ztlovelsw/dsh-model-profile README · 它解决什么：官方模型行能逐档编辑推理等级与输入类型，但**逐个模型手点**仍然费事；`reasoningEfforts` 的档位枚举、
接口取值，以及`contextWindow` / `maxTokens` 这些数字，在 models.dev 里本来就是现成的。
本插件把「按提供方一键拉齐」做成一个按钮，填的就是模型目录编辑器里的那些字段。

@ztlovelsw/dsh-model-profile README · 卸载：```sh
dsh plugin --profile web remove @ztlovelsw/dsh-model-profile
```

@ztlovelsw/dsh-model-profile README · The only entry point: 「Sync model capabilities」：The button reports progress and outcome in place (「Syncing…」 → 「Synced N fields」); hover for the match
count, the unlisted model IDs, and any write failures. Models models.dev does not list are left untouched. It
appears as soon as the row card renders — **no need to expand the model catalog**.

@ztlovelsw/dsh-model-profile README · The only entry point: 「Sync model capabilities」：**Every write is a one-shot seed**: once a field lands, the official row's own reasoning-level and input-type
controls are the only authority — the plugin never re-applies a value on a later save or reload, so an edit
made in the official control always stands.

@ztlovelsw/dsh-model-profile README · Model ID matching：1. **Namespace prefixes**: both separators are peeled — `/` and `:` — and they nest, so
   `cn:deepseek-v4.1-flash`, `ag/gemini-3.7-flash-high` and `openrouter/anthropic:claude-x-high` all resolve
   to `deepseek-v4.1-flash` / `gemini-3.7-flash` / `claude-x`;
2. **Reasoning-tier suffixes**: one more peel per level — `-high` / `-medium` / `-low` / `-extra-low` /
   `-thinking` / `-none`;
3. Same-id **first-party** entries (deepseek / google / openai / zai …) beat aggregator aliases.

@ztlovelsw/dsh-model-profile README · Uninstall：```sh
dsh plugin --profile web remove @ztlovelsw/dsh-model-profile
```
